  "description": "Bead mw-ju8.14: the riverbank under the Miners' Bridge in grey box, built from the e00 kit only. A 14 x 8 m shingle bank between two bridge piers (bridge-pier-west/east; the arch itself is art to come), reached by a short walled path from briar-glen-lane's riverbank-path transition (path-up leads back, arrive-from-briar-glen-lane arrives). Idris Quillon (npc-quillon), the robed teacher the Lantern Court has struck off, waits here between dusk and dawn only: his creature spawn and his lesson table (quillon-lessons, merchant bridge-sorcerer) carry presence {dusk, night}, so by day the bank is empty and the table does not answer. He sells the Ember lesson through the shop screen's Services tab. dev-crowns:600 tops the player up on first opening so the dev scene can pay. A shuttered blue lantern and a brazier mark the spot. Reach it with ?scene=under-the-bridge.",
